window.VAULT_CHUNKS={"CANONICAL/company-handbook.md": [{"c": "# Company Handbook\n\nThe authoritative source for how we operate. This document is **canonical**: it is\nimmutable and carries a 1.5x search boost in qp-vault.\n\n## Principles\n\n- Knowledge that can't be verified can't be trusted.\n- Every fact has provenance, every read is verified, every write is auditable.\n\n## Governance\n\nResources move through a lifecycle (draft, review, active, superseded, archived) and\ncarry a trust tier. Search results are weighted by tier.", "h": "vault://sha3-256/2a19522a7633ff6542c8e29c0f67349e734af6a326b4709af7c15ff491a467b0"}], "CANONICAL/security-policy.md": [{"c": "# Security Policy\n\nAll content entering the vault is screened by the Membrane, chunked, and assigned a\nSHA3-256 content id (CID). The CID is `vault://sha3-256/<digest>`.\n\n## Verification\n\nAnyone can re-derive a resource's content id offline and confirm it matches. Tampering\nwith stored content changes its CID and is detected immediately.", "h": "vault://sha3-256/32d04f0675bb54272cb188b9fda169775ba7f1004947c5d1b6c9a3917b8d2386"}], "WORKING/q3-roadmap-draft.md": [{"c": "# Q3 Roadmap (Draft)\n\nWorking draft, not yet authoritative. This supersedes the Q2 roadmap.\n\n## Themes\n\n1. Hybrid trust-weighted retrieval\n2. Knowledge-graph traversal\n3. Post-quantum signature rollout", "h": "vault://sha3-256/2642a6886b2b9495fe97ba513a9c7537744c7c091262c383fbf1592a27d62211"}], "EPHEMERAL/meeting-notes-2026-05-30.md": [{"c": "# Meeting Notes, 2026-05-30\n\nEphemeral capture. Lower search weight (0.7x). Safe to prune.\n\n- Reviewed the export format for the web explorer.\n- Agreed: governance must be visible at a glance.", "h": "vault://sha3-256/a59eeebff01669bee3d46700b23d1f54c6117947af03506a86e3d624ee727517"}], "ARCHIVED/q2-roadmap.md": [{"c": "# Q2 Roadmap (Archived)\n\nSuperseded by the Q3 roadmap. Retained for provenance and time-travel queries.\n\n## Shipped\n\n- Content addressing and Merkle verification\n- RBAC and the Membrane screening pipeline", "h": "vault://sha3-256/29bd3026a81becddceaa56de282f18fddcbf3101014d2ce41b12b41b32d8f962"}]};
